xposes and how it is built.",{"_96":387},"platform/pqc/go-toolchain.mdx",{"_72":389,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":390},"en:_8","Platform support",{"_72":392,"_79":89,"_74":50,"_83":393,"_92":-7,"_12":49,"_94":394},"en:platform/pqc/keys-and-cas.mdx","Create post-quantum keys and CAs, sign with them and issue certificates, with the engine support, API values and constraints that apply.",{"_96":395},"platform/pqc/keys-and-cas.mdx",{"_72":397,"_79":89,"_74":59,"_83":398,"_92":-7,"_12":58,"_94":399},"en:platform/pqc/related-certificates.mdx","Bind a certificate with a post-quantum key to an existing classical certificate of the same device, following RFC 9763, and how Lamassu issues and checks them.",{"_96":400},"platform/pqc/related-certificates.mdx",{"_72":402,"_79":89,"_74":32,"_83":403,"_92":-7,"_12":31,"_94":404},"en:platform/pqc/dashboard.mdx","How the web interface exposes post-quantum algorithms when creating keys, CAs and certificates, and how it displays them.",{"_96":405},"platform/pqc/dashboard.mdx",{"_72":407,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":408},"en:_9","Deployment",{"_72":410,"_79":89,"_74":62,"_83":411,"_92":-7,"_12":61,"_94":412},"en:platform/pqc/tls-front-proxy.mdx","The Traefik fork that terminates device TLS with classical and post-quantum certificates for the same host, how it picks a certificate and how it is built.",{"_96":413},"platform/pqc/tls-front-proxy.mdx",{"_72":415,"_79":89,"_74":35,"_83":416,"_92":-7,"_12":34,"_94":417},"en:platform/pqc/deployment.mdx","Deploy Lamassu with a Traefik front proxy that serves classical, post-quantum and composite certificates, using the chart values or the fast-lane installer.",{"_96":418},"platform/pqc/deployment.mdx",{"_72":420,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":421},"en:_10","Integration tests",{"_72":423,"_79":89,"_74":47,"_83":424,"_92":-7,"_12":46,"_94":425},"en:platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx","Evidence that software outside Lamassu negotiates post-quantum key exchange and verifies post-quantum and composite certificates served by Lamassu.",{"_96":426},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/overview.mdx",{"_72":428,"_79":89,"_74":41,"_83":429,"_92":-7,"_12":40,"_94":430},"en:platform/pqc/integration-tests/https.mdx","Results of testing a Lamassu HTTPS endpoint with OpenSSL and curl using post-quantum key exchange and post-quantum and composite certificates.",{"_96":431},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/https.mdx",{"_72":433,"_79":89,"_74":44,"_83":434,"_92":-7,"_12":43,"_94":435},"en:platform/pqc/integration-tests/mqtts.mdx","Results of testing an MQTT broker behind the Lamassu TLS front proxy with mosquitto, using post-quantum key exchange and post-quantum and composite certificates.",{"_96":436},"platform/pqc/integration-tests/mqtts.mdx",{"_72":438,"_79":117,"_92":-7,"_74":439},"en:_11","Reference",{"_72":441,"_79":89,"_74":53,"_83":442,"_92":-7,"_12":52,"_94":443},"en:platform/pqc/limitations.mdx","What is incomplete, non-standard or unverified in Lamassu's post-quantum support, grouped by component.",{"_96":444},"platform/pqc/limitations.mdx","en:platform/pqc",{"_231":447},"platform/pqc/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-atom shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M20.2 20.2c2.04-2.03.02-7.36-4.5-11.9-4.54-4.52-9.87-6.54-11.9-4.5-2.04 2.03-.02 7.36 4.5 11.9 4.54 4.52 9.87 6.54 11.9 4.5Z\"></path><path d=\"M15.7 15.7c4.52-4.54 6.54-9.87 4.5-11.9-2.03-2.04-7.36-.02-11.9 4.5-4.52 4.54-6.54 9.87-4.5 11.9 2.03 2.04 7.36.02 11.9-4.5Z\"></path></svg>",{"_79":80,"_74":450,"_81":-7,"_82":-7,"_83":-7,"_85":-7,"_76":451,"_72":473,"_94":474,"_92":-7},"Administration",[452,459,466],{"_72":453,"_79":89,"_74":454,"_83":455,"_92":-7,"_12":456,"_94":457},"en:platform/administration/access-control.mdx","Access control","Design who can access Lamassu thro